/ Stage 8g (decision 151): a retry is a fresh attempt with its own deadline. The first two attempts are slow and
/ time out; the third is fast. With one shared deadline the third attempt would start already cancelled.
Start
- set %attempts% = 0
- call SlowTwice, timeout after 100ms, on error retry 2 times
- assert %attempts% equals 3, "each retry has its own deadline"

SlowTwice
- set %attempts% = %attempts% + 1
- if %attempts% is less than 3, call Slow

Slow
- sleep 1 second
